SUMMARY:Summer Film Series: The Mummy (1999)
DESCRIPTION:The second film in our Summer Film Series\, showcasing films 
 that fit perfectly alongside the Summer Reading Program Theme "Unearth a 
 Story". Movie theater candy will be provided!\n\n\nThe Mummy (1999) | 
 PG-13\n\nAt an archaeological dig in the ancient city of Hamunaptra\, an 
 American serving in the French Foreign Legion accidentally awakens a mummy 
 who begins to wreak havoc as he searches for the reincarnation of his 
 long-lost love. Watch the trailer here.\n\nSeating is first come\, first 
 served. Registration is not required\, but recommended for reminders and 
 updates.\n\nSign up for summer reading here for children\, teens\, and 
 adults! Earn tickets for your reading and enter to win exciting prizes!
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Auditorium\, Montclair Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Library":MAILTO:events@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Adult Services, Books, Film & Theater, Teen Services
