SUMMARY:Simple Sitting Meditation (15 minutes)
DESCRIPTION:The Mindful Stream\nIn these sessions\, I will be doing guided
  meditations where we simply sit and notice what arises.\n\nThere is no ag
 enda and no plan for how these sessions unfold. I might start off simply b
 y asking us to notice what is already present. By becoming aware of what
 ’s going on in our heads and in our body.\n\nThen\, the meditation may t
 ake on a life of its own.\n\nOur job is to simply be present to what arise
 s. We may notice the mind moving and chattering about. Or we may notice th
 at it’s completely silent.\n\nThe goal here\, if there is one\, is to si
 mply let ourselves be as we are.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/themindfulstream/events/315442081/
