 he comments if different from here. I will edit the event accordingly as n
 eeded in trying and accommodate as many people as possible.\n\n(Also let m
 e know if you have any interest in also doing a Saturday or Sunday afterno
 on at the Nyack location since they have a huge mall there as well.)\n\nWe
 dnesday is half price for all games except VR. Everyone is responsible for
  all their own food/drinks games. If sharing games like pool then please s
 plit the cost evenly between each participant.\n\nI’m generally thinking
