SUMMARY:Ulysses Quartet Concert
DESCRIPTION:July 23 at 7PM on the Wisteria Terrace behind Van Vleck House\nJoin the vibrant\, young and award-winning Ulysses Quartet for an unforgettable evening at Van Vleck House & Gardens. Their engaging program weaves together classical favorites\, contemporary works\, and traditional folk melodies\, showcasing the quartet’s celebrated virtuosity and vibrant musical storytelling.\nBring a blanket or lawn chairs. No pets\, alcohol or food permitted.\nFree for members\, $10 for non-members. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
