SUMMARY:House History Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Do you want to know more about the history of your house? Join 
 Ken French\, our local history librarian\, and Nicholas Muller\, 
 Collections Manager at the Montclair History Center\, as we show you some 
 of the ways you can find out more about your property.\n\nAttendees need to 
 provide us with the current block and lot numbers of their property at the 
 time of the event.\n\nPlease note that\, due to the size of the room\, we 
 cannot fit more than ten people total for this workshop. Please register in 
 advance.
