SUMMARY:Family Yoga at Van Vleck
DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, July 25th\, 9:30 – 10:15 AM \nFamily yoga is such a beautiful way to come together\, slow down\, and truly connect. This class is designed for all levels\, so whether you’re brand new or have been practicing for years\, everyone can move at their own pace and feel supported. Through gentle movement\, breathwork\, and a little bit of playful energy\, you’ll build strength\, improve flexibility\, and release stress as a family. It’s not about being perfect—it’s about sharing the experience\, laughing\, and creating meaningful moments together. Walking out\, you’ll feel more grounded\, more connected\, and just a little lighter as a family unit. \nPlease bring a yoga mat or towel. \nSuggested age: 5 and up. All children must be accompanied by an adult.\nFee: $20/family for members; $25/family for general public \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/family-yoga-at-van-vleck/
LOCATION:Van Vleck House & Gardens\, 21 Van Vleck Street\, Montclair\, NJ\, 07042\, United States
CATEGORIES:Kids & Families
