SUMMARY:Pickering Valley Watershed Hike
DESCRIPTION:Metrotrails: NJ\, PA\, NY Metropolitan Area Hiking and More!\n
 Join us for this interesting point to point hike in the Pickering Creek wa
 tershed outside of Phoenixville PA.\nAfter meeting at the Schuylkill Towns
 hip Municipal Building\, where there is a park\, we will shuttle with as f
 ew cars as possible west to the Bryn Coed Preserve.\nOur day will start ou
 t hiking some of the trails through here we had not done in the past\, the
 n make our way to Historic Yellow Springs via pleasant back roads. Here\, 
 we'll walk a partial loop trail we've not yet done called North Ridge Trai
 l.\nA couple more back roads lead us to Pine Creek Park where we'll pick u
 p the trails along the Pickering.\nThere will be a combination of creeksid
 e tails and pleasant backroads.\nDistance will be 15 miles. Contact me at 
 908 343 8374 if needed.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/metrotrails/events/315747547/
