SUMMARY:Buck Full Moon Gathering for Healing and Clarity
DESCRIPTION:Join sound bowl healer Danielle Taylor\, astrologer Pia Wilson\, and healer Lisa Batitto for an afternoon of reflection\, renewal\, and community in preparation for the energy of the Buck Full Moon. The event includes a calming sound bowl meditation\, intuitive astrology insights\, and a group Akashic Records reading and healing circle. \nOften associated with growth\, resilience\, and moving into the next stage of one’s journey\, the Buck Moon offers an opportunity to release what no longer serves\, strengthen inner wisdom\, and create space for new possibilities. The afternoon will conclude with a grounding practice to help everyone leave feeling deeply connected to themselves. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/buck-full-moon-gathering-for-healing-and-clarity/
LOCATION:Blu Lotus\, 20 Church St.\, Montclair\, NJ\, United States
CATEGORIES:Community
