SUMMARY:Queer Cabaret
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for another unforgettable evening of Queer Cabaret at the MC Hotel’s Allegory Lounge! \nWe are thrilled to announce our headline\, Sammulous! Sammulous is a 7-time Apollo Theater winner and featured performer from America’s Got Talent Season 12. With a powerhouse voice\, magnetic stage presence\, and unforgettable energy\, Sammulous is sure to bring the house down. \nWhether you’re coming with friends\, your partner\, or flying solo\, Queer Cabaret promises an evening filled with many incredible performances. \nSeats are limited. Grab your tickets today and join us for a night to remember! \nhttps://www.zeffy.com/en-US/ticketing/queer-cabaret-july-27th \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
