SUMMARY:Nocturnal Animals Family Event at Van Vleck Gardens
DESCRIPTION:Spend an exciting early evening in the Van Vleck Gardens meeting nocturnal animals from Eyes of the Wild\, an exotic animal rescue. Learn about these fascinating creatures who are awake while we are asleep. This presentation is for families with children 5 and up\, but all are welcome. This program will be held outdoors (moving indoors if it rains). Registration required. \nFee: Family Rate: $30 per family – Members; $40 per family – General Public\nIndividual Rate: $15 per person – Members; $20 per person – General Public \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/nocturnal-animals-family-event-at-van-vleck-gardens/
