SUMMARY:Summer Film Series: Atlantis: The Lost Empire (2001)
DESCRIPTION:The third film in our Summer Film Series\, showcasing films 
 that fit perfectly alongside the Summer Reading Program Theme "Unearth a 
 Story". Movie theater candy will be provided!\n\n\nAtlantis: The Lost 
 Empire (2001) | PG\n\nA young linguist named Milo Thatch joins an intrepid 
 group of explorers to find the mysterious lost continent of Atlantis. Watch 
 the trailer here.\n\nSeating is first come\, first served. Registration is 
 not required\, but recommended for reminders and updates.\n\nSign up for 
 summer reading here for children\, teens\, and adults! Earn tickets for 
 your reading and enter to win exciting prizes!
