DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260731T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260731T110000
SUMMARY:Let's Walk!! the Pompton Valley Rail Trail
DESCRIPTION:Let's Walk!!\nThere's a new multi-use paved path in Pequannock
 \, so let's check it out. Opened in 2025\, it's one of Morris County Parks
  newest and largest trail initiatives.\n\nWe'll meet at 9:30 to walk to th
 e northern terminus and back. It's about 3 miles and we'll finish in about
  75 minutes.\n\nFeeling strong and adventurous? Come at 7:00 and we'll wal
 k to the southern end and back before the others join us. This section is 
 an additional 7 miles to go out and back.\n\nBring water. Wear good shoes 
 and a hat (some sections are quite exposed). There are several street cros
 sings.\n\n[Want more info? Click HERE](https://www.morrisparks.net/parks_t
 rails/pompton-valley-rail-trail/)\n\n**Please make sure to RSVP and arrive
  5 minutes prior to start time.**\n**We start promptly at the time posted.
 **\n\nFOLLOW US ON INSTAGRAM - letswalkmeetup\n\nDisclaimer: If you join u
 s for a hike\, please understand that you are responsible for your own pre
 paredness and well-being and will hold no one else liable in case of injur
 y or mishap. Event will be canceled in the event of extreme weather.
