SUMMARY:Escape Room Time - North Jersey
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\nIt is esc
 ape room time.\n\nThe event comes to you courtesy of our WhatsApp group ch
 at.\n\nJoin us at 7:30 p.m. on July 31 at Amazing Escape Room\, 281 Libert
 y St. in Bloomfield.\n\nThis event will require a little planning and coor
 dination. The cost per person will be based on the number of people. A 10%
  discount is available for groups of 10 or more. Technically\, a room can 
 only accommodate up to 10\, 11 or 12 people. If there's significant intere
 st\, we can talk about getting two rooms. With that in mind\, the cost per
  person will be between $25 and $35. No food or drinks are allowed on site
 . There is street parking.\n\nOnce I finalize a list\, I'll let everyone k
 now what they owe in advance of July 31. Please comment below or reach out
  to me directly (201-234-9609) if you're still interested in attending.\n\
 nhttps://amazingescaperoom.com/all-rooms/\n\n\\*\\*\\* There is a good cha
 nce we'll hang out some more at a diner or bar afterward. Feel free to mak
 e suggestions!! \\*\\*\\*\n\nQuestions or comments? You can message Andy o
 n Meetup\, or call/text him at 201-234-9609.\n\nThis is our first escape r
 oom trip. Feel free to also check out bowling\, soccer\, volleyball\, tenn
 is or one of our other activities at: www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-
 soccer-volleyball.
