SUMMARY:NEW DATE!! FBAL presents The Grand Spectacular Community Yard Sale Fundraiser
DESCRIPTION:The first annual Friends of the Bellevue Avenue Library Grand 
 Spectacular Community Yard Sale is coming to you on Saturday\, July 18th 
 Saturday August 1st!\n\nIf you have stuff to sell\, why not sell it in 
 support of the library\, and join a community of neighbors doing the same! 
 BYO table or blanket!\n\nSign up in person at the circulation desk at the 
 Bellevue Ave. Branch (cash or check only) or the day of the 
 sale!\n\nRegistrations will be $20\, so sign up today!
