SUMMARY:Microraptor's Make & Mingle (ages 3-10)
DESCRIPTION:Feeling creative? Mikey the Microraptor has some fun 
 dinosaur-themed crafts to keep your hands busy! On Monday mornings\, we 
 will have a craft project prepared for children to take home and make OR to 
 stay in the library to make with others. First come\, first served\, while 
 supplies last!\n\n[Please note\, June  29th will have a 4th of July themed 
 craft.]\n\n
