SUMMARY:The Photographer’s Eye 2: Enhancing Your Vision NEW
DESCRIPTION:Note: This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to 
 register.\n\nPhotographer’s Eye 2 invites photographers who feel 
 (somehow) comfortable with their cameras to continue developing their 
 photographic vision.\n\nAcross two 3-hour classes participants will explore 
 composition\, perspective\, and storytelling through hands-on activities\, 
 group discussion\, and a photo walk designed to inspire fresh ways of 
 seeing.\n
