BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Campuslabs Montclair": "https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12500880"}
X-SOURCE-ID:campuslabs_montclair
X-SOURCE:Montclair State University
CATEGORIES:GroupBusiness
CATEGORIES:Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Ready to take your business beyond U.S. borders? Join us for a
  FREE two-part workshop series designed to transform your growth from loc
 al to worldwide. On August 4\, we'll explore whether exporting is the rig
 ht move for your business\, assess your readiness\, and identify which of
  your products or services have international demand. By August 18\, you'
 ll be ready for part two\, where we'll dive into the real logistics—findi
 ng international buyers\, navigating permits and paperwork\, and mapping 
 out your clear path forward. Expert facilitator Reina Valenzuela will gui
 de you through the opportunities\, close your knowledge gaps\, and leave 
 you with a concrete action plan. Whether you're curious about global expa
 nsion or ready to take the leap\, this free series gives you the framewor
 k and clarity to do it right.\n\nHosted by: Feliciano Center for Entrepre
 neurship and Innovation\n\nOnline Location: https://montclair.zoom.us/j/9
 6930200081?pwd=9oJKVgFockTYMtegcSQDmVaSxS73nK.1\n\nAdditional Information
  can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12500880
