SUMMARY:Paperbook Pals Book Club (Grades rising 3-5) BELLEVUE AVE. BRANCH
DESCRIPTION:Every other month\, we gather to discuss a high-interest 
 chapter book or graphic novel. We will check for understanding\, share 
 opinions and also make a small craft.\n\nThis month's book will be The Best 
 Worst Summer (by Elizabeth Fulberg).\n\n\n\n \n\nRegistration required.
