SUMMARY:Summer Film Series: The Goonies (1985)
DESCRIPTION:The final date for our Summer Film Series\, showcasing films 
 that we think fit perfectly alongside the Summer Reading Program Theme 
 "Unearth a Story". Movie theater candy will be provided!\n\n\nThe Goonies 
 (1985) | PG\n\nA group of young misfits called The Goonies discover an 
 ancient map and set out on an adventure to find a legendary pirate's 
 long-lost treasure. Watch the trailer here.\n\nSeating is first come\, 
 first served. Registration is not required\, but recommended for reminders 
 and updates.\n\nSign up for summer reading here for children\, teens\, and 
 adults! Earn tickets for your reading and enter to win exciting prizes!
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Auditorium\, Montclair Public Library
