SUMMARY:Graphic Novel Book Club (18 ) Charity & Sylvia by Tillie Walden
DESCRIPTION: \n\nCharity & Sylvia by Tillie Walden\n\nAn openly Lesbian 
 couple survives and thrives in 19th century\n\nVermont–a true story\, as 
 told by Tillie Walden\n\nCopies of the book will be available to pick up at 
 the BAB Library. \n\nRegistration is required.\n\nThis book club is 
 exclusive for those 18 or older\, as some materials may contain content not 
 suitable for younger audiences.\n\n\n
