SUMMARY:MLflow 3.12 for Agentic AI: PromptOps\, Observability & AI Evaluat
 ion
DESCRIPTION:Cloud Data Driven\nEnable production-grade Agentic AI through 
 Prompt Ops\, tracing\, observability\, and AI evaluation. This live demo s
 ession showcases prompt versioning\, multi-agent tracing\, hallucination d
 etection\, and evaluation workflows to help enterprises operationalize gov
 erned\, observable\, and scalable GenAI systems with real-world deployment
  patterns.\n\nBy the end of this session\, attendees will be able to:\n-Un
 derstand how MLflow 3.12 supports PromptOps\, AgentOps\, and AI evaluation
 \n\n-Implement prompt versioning\, tracing\, and observability for Agentic
  AI systems\n\n-Monitor and debug multi-agent workflows using MLflow Traci
 ng\n\n-Evaluate GenAI quality using LLM-based evaluation frameworks\n\n-Ap
 ply enterprise-ready governance and operationalization patterns for scalab
 le GenAI deployment
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/cloud-data-driven/events/315354659/
