SUMMARY:CPR Training with Beat to Breathe CPR
DESCRIPTION:Come take a free basic CPR training class with Beat to Breathe 
 CPR! This introductory class will give you the confidence and knowledge to 
 feel prepared in emergencies.\n\n\nFree training class for layperson CPR 
 knowledge. Please be advised this is not a certification course.\n\nABOUT 
 BEAT TO BREATHE CPR\n\nAs a registered 501(c)(3) nonprofit\, Beat to 
 Breathe CPR is dedicated to enhancing community health and safety by 
 providing affordable\, accessible CPR training to individuals of all ages 
 and backgrounds. Established in 2022\, we have remained committed to 
 empowering every student with life-saving skills and fostering a community 
 that is confident and prepared to respond effectively in emergencies.
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Auditorium
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Library":MAILTO:events@montclairlibrary.org
