DESCRIPTION:Join us for some yummy\, hot pizza inside our beautiful commun
 ity sukkah (weather permitting\, else indoors).   \n  \nCandlelighting to 
 bring in Shabbat\, around 6:00pm  \nFamily Friendly Kabbalat Shabbat Servi
 ce\, at 6:30pm  \nIce Cream Sundaes in the Sukkah to follow!   \n  \nEvery
 one is invited - Preschool\, JLC &amp\; Congregation. Bring friends!  \n  
 \n**Free**  \nDonations to help defray the cost greatly appreciated.  \n  
 \n**RSVP** https://www.google.com/url?q=https://shomrei.easyshul.com/event
 s/68c37b41dcef430026ffbf15&sa=D&source=calendar&ust=1779731381522788&usg=A
 OvVaw0uVmNcjZTYanoKhbUj32h0  \n  \n**Questions?**  \nContact Melissa Mehl 
  \nOperations Manager  \nmmehl@shomrei.org  \n(973) 746-5031\,[](https://w
 ww.google.com/url?q=http://voice.google.com/calls?a%3Dnc\,%252B19737465031
 &sa=D&source=calendar&ust=1779731381522788&usg=AOvVaw2OEnGhQxO5M11Z4mRl_xE
 7) x101\n\n
